>touch dust bunny
WHOOSH! Your fist swipes through the dust bunny.
  SNAP! A spark leaps between your hand and the dust bunny!
  [Your endurance just went down.]
  A bright blue SNAP of electricity lights the room! In the blink of an eye, the dust bunny draws itself together into a hard ring of particles, which falls with a clatter to your feet.
  [Your experience just went up. You have achieved the rank of Level 2 Female Peasant.]
  [Your endurance is back to normal.]

