>cut onion
[with the dagger]
  Your two-week stint as a short-order cook in Borphee stands you in good stead as you slash the giant onion's surface.
  The dorn's multiple eyes turn red and watery under the pungent influence of the giant onion. "Hurumph!" it wails, utterly helpless.
  Your eyes become red and itchy as the giant onion's potent miasma fills the air.
  The dorn almost crashes into you in its blind frenzy. "Hurumph!" it cries, its face soaked with tears.

