>open chest
As you reach towards the chest, you notice a brass plate inscribed with the words "Do Not Open This Chest."

>open chest
Rays of golden light burst from the sea chest's interior as the lid creaks open. You're bathed in a chorus of radiant ecstasy that almost drowns out the telltale snap of an opening Gate.



















































































































































































































































Plane of TransInfinite Splendor

>
▐              Plane of TransInfinite Splendor               ▌        │    ╱
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐        │   ╱
│An unspoiled landscape of rolling meadows, sparkling        │        │  ╱
│streams and orchards bursting with fruit stretches away in  │        │ ╱
│every direction. You must be alone here; for no woman       │       ▄▄▄
│could visit this place and leave it voluntarily.            │       ▐█▌
│  A herd of unicorns grazes peacefully among the trees.     │       ▀▀▀
│                                                            │          ╲
│                                                            │           ╲
│                                                            │            ╲
│                                                            │             ╲
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

>wait
Time passes.
  One of the mares glances up as you stand gawking at the landscape. Her nostrils flare with surprise, and a high-pitched voice in your head cries, "Intruder!"
  The herd springs to full alert. Mothers nudge their frightened colts out of sight, then gallop away between the trees. Within moments, the glade is completely deserted.

>
▐              Plane of TransInfinite Splendor               ▌        │    ╱
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐        │   ╱
