│streams and orchards bursting with fruit stretches away in  │        │ ╱
│every direction. You must be alone here; for no woman       │       ▄▄▄
│could visit this place and leave it voluntarily.            │       ▐█▌
│                                                            │       ▀▀▀
│                                                            │          ╲
│                                                            │           ╲
│                                                            │            ╲
│                                                            │             ╲
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

>wait
Time passes.
  The stillness is broken by the rumble of approaching hooves. Before you can think or move, you find yourself enclosed by a dozen sharp horns, each backed by a unicorn in full military regalia.
  A magnificent stallion regards you with calm authority. "You will find no welcome here, earth-dweller," whispers a stern voice in your mind. "Our children must never know the pain we suffered at the hands of Men. Return to your people now, and describe the fate awaiting any who dares to violate our solitude again."
  A lifetime of humiliating drudgery passes before your eyes. You cry out with pain and heartache as you haul wagons full of overweight aristocrats, standing silent and powerless as cruel taskmasters whip you over and over again...


















































































































































































































































