>put potion in pack
You put the dark potion in the pack.
  The pterodactyl screeches pitifully.

>get hurdy-gurdy
You take the hurdy-gurdy out of the pack.

>get weed
You take the limp weed out of the pack.

>turn dial to ear
CLICK. You turn the dial until it points to the picture of an ear.
  The pterodactyl flutters its good wing back and forth.

>turn crank right
You turn the crank on the hurdy-gurdy to the right, and watch as a soft violet glow brightens the rim of the closed lid.
  Strains of soothing melody fill the air! You can't help but close your eyes for a moment as the liquid chords swell to a glorious crescendo, then fade into silence.
  A tear trembles on the pterodactyl's beak. You watch as it closes his eyes, swaying his skinny head back and forth with drowsy reminiscences. Soon his snore drowns out the fading song.

>
