>get arrow
You gently touch the end of the arrow, probing with your fingers. It barely gives at all.
  Gritting your teeth, you grasp the shaft firmly, close your eyes and give it a quick, determined yank.
  RIP. The arrow pulls free, and dark blood trickles from the wound.
  The pterodactyl caws softly in its dreams.

>
