│  A group of Implementors is seated around a food-laden     │       ▄▄▄
│table, glaring at you angrily.                              │───────▐█▌───────
│  There's a coconut here.                                   │       ▀▀▀
│                                                            │        │ ╲
│                                                            │        │  ╲
