>examine scarecrow
Considering the stormy climate hereabouts, it's remarkable that this scarecrow is still standing. Threadbare mauve rags hang from the wooden limbs, flapping in the steady wind.
  A movement overhead catches your eye.
  Oh, my. A small farmhouse is falling out of the clouds! You watch it spin as it tumbles earthward, and hear the CRUNCH of splintering lumber somewhere nearby.
  Corbies squawk with terror overhead.

