>get hurdy-gurdy
You take the hurdy-gurdy out of the pack.
  The wind outside grows from a rumble to a roar as the churning vortex whirls closer.
  Corbies croak with fury overhead.

>open hurdy-gurdy
A wraith of colored light seeps out as you open it.
  The wind outside rises to a deafening shriek, and blowing dust turns the day to night.
  THWACK! The farm house jerks violently upward, throwing you to your knees. You feel a strange whirling sensation as the floor begins to dip and sway like the deck of a boat. A glance out the window confirms what your popping ears already know: The farm house is soaring high above the Fields of Frotzen, caught in the vortex of a mighty tornado!
  The butterfly explores the rim of the goblet.

