>close hurdy-gurdy
The hurdy-gurdy creaks shut.
  The floor lurches crazily underfoot.

>turn dial to clock
CLICK. You turn the dial until it points to the picture of a clock.
  The entire farm house shudders as the tornado loosens its grip. It feels as if you're starting to fall!

>turn crank left
You turn the crank on the hurdy-gurdy to the left, and watch as a soft crimson glow brightens the rim of the closed lid.
  A black tide of memory swells in your mind! You blush with shame as thoughtless deeds and filthy little secrets emerge from the dark reaches of your past to taunt you.
  CRASH! The farm house strikes the ground with a sickening thud. You're thrown across the room, hit your head and...





A ray of sunlight opens your eyes.

>open hurdy-gurdy
A strange sense of urgency seeps out as you open it.

>get goblet
You take the goblet out of the hurdy-gurdy.

>examine goblet
Despite a sticky coating on the inside, the goblet gleams with the lustre of pure gold. There's a caterpillar resting on the rim.

>put hurdy-gurdy in pack
You put the hurdy-gurdy in the pack.

>wait
Time passes.

>wait
Time passes.
  The caterpillar silently explores the goblet.

>wait
Time passes.

>wait
Time passes.
  The caterpillar wiggles its antennae.

>wait
Time passes.
  The caterpillar crawls across the goblet.

>wait
Time passes.

>wait
Time passes.

>wait
Time passes.
  The caterpillar wiggles its way around the goblet.

