>wait
Time passes.
  An important-looking man, tinier than all the rest, emerges from the crowd.
  "Greetings, brave sorceress," he mumbles, grovelling at your feet. "I am Grope, Mayor of the City of Froon. On behalf of us all, I welcome you!"
  "Welcome! Welcome to the sorceress!" echoes the crowd joyfully.

