>wait
Time passes.
  "For over three hundred years, my people have suffered in the shadow of the Heeled One," explains the Mayor, glancing hatefully at the enormous boot. "At long last, his evil-smelling reign is at an end!"
  "Huzzah!" cries the crowd, dancing gleefully around the farm house. "Huzzah! The Boot is licked!"

>wait
Time passes.
  "Such a mighty deed commands many thanks," continues the Mayor. "Bring me the Cask!"
  "The Cask! The Mayor sends for the Cask!" whispers the crowd as a servant disappears into the flower beds. Moments later he returns bearing a small jewel box, which is delivered to the Mayor.

