>wait
Time passes.
  The Mayor opens the jewel box with a grand flourish.
  "Behold!" he cries. "Herein lie the Keys to the Kingdom of Froon. This gift is the greatest honor my people can bestow. Humbly, and with eternal gratitude, do we offer one to you."
  The crowd redoubles its cheering.

>examine keys
There are three keys, colored mauve, puce and lavender.
  "Choose any key you like," prompts the Mayor helpfully.

>take mauve key
You ceremoniously lift the mauve key out of the jewel box.
  "An excellent choice," remarks the Mayor. "Bye!"



















































































































































































































































