>get staff
You take the staff of Levitation out of the pack.
  The baby hungus bellows helplessly, and its mother responds.

>point stick at mother hungus
BLIT! A zone of negative geometry forms in the space around the mother hungus, effectively turning her inside out. This disconcerting effect lasts only for a moment; but long enough for the undigested contents of the mother hungus's stomach to fall to the ground.
  [Your strength just went down.]

>
