Time passes.
  "Show yerself, ye flea-bit mop!"
  A young man strides out of the woods, an angry scowl on his windburned face... and a nasty-looking whip in his hands.
  "Yo, ma'am!" he cries, drawing closer. "Lost a minx 'ereabouts! Came this way, if th' trail speaks truly."
  Something behind the oak tree whimpers softly.

