>look under pew
Peering under the pew, you see a vial.
  "Who can stop the marching Trees?" mourns Cardinal Toolbox, beating his breast hopelessly. "Orkan's Glyphs are all that keep the monsters at bay. But Orkan answers not our summons; only one Glyph remains, and that is writ in snow!"

>get vial
Taken.
  "The southern mountains are their nest," mourns Cardinal Toolbox, wringing his hands. "They march relentlessly, choking the valley with their foul gifts and blasphemous songs. They know the wizard's Glyph is melting, and with it fades our only hope!"

>stand up
You slide quietly off the pew.
  The minx jumps off the pew.
  "Where is the Savior of whom our legends speak?" whines Cardinal Toolbox, beating his breast hopelessly. "Anything she asks will be her reward, if only she fulfills the ancient prophecy, and drives the plague of Tree-daemons from our doorstep!"

