>read book
You nosily thumb the pages.

 "23 JULY. Hot again. Retorts and alembics spoiling! Hate this northern clime.
  26 JULY. Gated Thriff to Miznia, via Atrii. Relief at last! Villagers perplexed but grateful.
  2 AUGUST. Mtn not dormant after all. Yonked a girgol just in nick of time.
  9 AUGUST. Wilderness life stinks. Raccoon nest in chimney; guncho took flue and all! Broke last burin warding off Xmas pests. Better off up north?
  13 AUGUST. Borphee tomorrow. Y'Gael MUST be wrong."

  A tiny glyph is scrawled beside the entry dated "9 August." It looks just like the one you saw outside.

>search bench
You carefully sift through the chemicals, and turn up a black hemisphere.

