Courtyard, on a pterodactyl
  Without warning, a ghoul leaps out of the rubble!
  The pterodactyl takes one good look at the ghoul and decides that he doesn't want to play horsey anymore. Before you can think or move, you find yourself sprawling across the dust, with a cowardly shadow soaring out of sight overhead.
  The minx frees itself and lands on the ground.

