>get root
Reaching carefully to avoid the thorns, you yank a loose root out from under the morgia bush.
  A whirlpool of twinkling light forms in the garden. Something is beginning to materialize!
  The pterodactyl beats its wings restlessly.

>
▐            Royal Garden, behind the morgia bush            ▌
