>look into sphere
You fix your gaze deep within the crystal, and watch its swirling depths coalesce into the image of a warlock, standing before a seamless wall of stone. He mutters the word "Blarn," and a doorlike outline appears which he pushes open. The vision fades as he steps inside.

>put rose in pack
You put the rose in the pack.

>put reliquary in pack
You put the reliquary in the pack.

>put scroll in pack
You put the scroll of Gating in the pack.

>get clover
You take the four-leaf clover out of the pack.

>get rabbit's foot
You take the rabbit's foot out of the pack.

>open jar
You open the crystal jar.
  You feel the wind changing direction.

>take circlet
You take the circlet out of the crystal jar.

>blarn
The ground shudders at the sound of your voice, and the outline of a door appears in the rock wall.
  The wind changes direction again.

